Juno wouldn't wanna drop it.

278
00:16:39,280 --> 00:16:40,520
I trust you.

279
00:16:43,680 --> 00:16:46,000
And I want you to trust me, too.

280
00:16:49,320 --> 00:16:50,500
I'm scared.

281
00:17:02,430 --> 00:17:03,720
I am, too.

282
00:17:05,430 --> 00:17:07,520
I know it's stupid of me to do this,

283
00:17:08,530 --> 00:17:10,400
but it's probably the last thing

284
00:17:10,839 --> 00:17:13,400
I can at least do for him as his fan.

285
00:17:37,930 --> 00:17:38,730
Nine,

286
00:17:39,650 --> 00:17:42,680
after the press conference,
you're taking a group photo like always.

287
00:17:42,930 --> 00:17:44,140
Be on standby.

288
00:17:44,420 --> 00:17:45,040
Okay.

289
00:17:48,130 --> 00:17:50,910
Hi there, peeps!

290
00:17:50,930 --> 00:17:52,730
Hi, hi.

291
00:17:57,540 --> 00:17:58,200
Oh?

292
00:17:58,220 --> 00:17:59,090
Toto,

293
00:17:59,110 --> 00:18:00,310
why the hell are you here?

294
00:18:00,340 --> 00:18:00,760
Get out!

295
00:18:00,780 --> 00:18:01,800
No, why are you here?

296
00:18:03,400 --> 00:18:04,280
Get out.

297
00:18:04,760 --> 00:18:05,690
Oh, well...

298
00:18:05,710 --> 00:18:06,680
I am...

299
00:18:06,990 --> 00:18:09,400
your hairstylist. I'm here to
do your hair, of course.

300
00:18:09,530 --> 00:18:11,800
Jeez, I was only a bit late,

301
00:18:11,820 --> 00:18:13,340
and you went that far to tease me.

302
00:18:13,360 --> 00:18:14,200
Come on.

303
00:18:14,220 --> 00:18:15,490
Toto, move!

304
00:18:30,030 --> 00:18:33,200
I just went out for a meal with Juno.

305
00:18:33,230 --> 00:18:35,200
I didn't talk or gossip about you one bit.

306
00:18:36,920 --> 00:18:39,130
Toto, sweetie, go wait in the other room.

307
00:18:39,150 --> 00:18:40,450
Let them talk it out, alright?

308
00:18:40,470 --> 00:18:41,230
No need.

309
00:18:42,320 --> 00:18:43,340
Stay here.

310
00:18:46,660 --> 00:18:47,720
Don't lie.

311
00:18:48,200 --> 00:18:50,520
This isn't just about you
going out to eat with that damn Juno.

312
00:18:51,220 --> 00:18:53,630
Are you saying you don't know
the woman in that photo?

313
00:18:53,650 --> 00:18:54,480
Hm?

314
00:18:57,530 --> 00:18:58,310
Uh...

315
00:18:58,330 --> 00:19:00,030
Who is she anyway?

316
00:19:01,530 --> 00:19:03,680
It's the owner of the account
"doyouseemenine."

317
00:19:04,920 --> 00:19:05,400
Huh?

318
00:19:06,110 --> 00:19:07,110
What did you say?

319
00:19:07,710 --> 00:19:08,610
Nine,

320
00:19:09,950 --> 00:19:11,800
I didn't do it. I swear.

321
00:19:16,740 --> 00:19:18,720
What am I gonna do with you, Rin?

322
00:19:22,110 --> 00:19:24,500
I just had a meal with that damn Juno...

323
00:19:24,520 --> 00:19:26,930
Like I told you, it was just a meal.

324
00:19:26,950 --> 00:19:27,640
And...

325
00:19:27,760 --> 00:19:29,940
he brought someone random.
I didn't even know who she was...

326
00:19:29,960 --> 00:19:31,040
Bullshit!

327
00:19:34,220 --> 00:19:36,440
I don't think you can
stay in this career anymore.

328
00:19:37,800 --> 00:19:39,030
Or even if you could,

329
00:19:40,080 --> 00:19:41,520
I doubt it'd be in this industry.

330
00:19:42,010 --> 00:19:44,320
Maybe you could go back to doing
university cheerleaders' hair again?

331
00:19:44,430 --> 00:19:46,020
Right, Susan?

332
00:19:46,680 --> 00:19:47,640
Uh...

333
00:19:51,040 --> 00:19:51,880
I'm sorry.

334
00:19:53,410 --> 00:19:54,840
I'm sorry...

335
00:19:55,090 --> 00:19:56,770
If you want, I can stop
talking, contacting,

336
00:19:56,790 --> 00:19:58,090
or even cut him loose entirely.

337
00:19:58,110 --> 00:20:00,320
But...could you give me a chance?

338
00:20:00,530 --> 00:20:02,020
I'm sorry. Please give me a chance.

339
00:20:02,040 --> 00:20:02,920
I can...

340
00:20:03,130 --> 00:20:05,000
I can even bow at your feet.

341
00:20:13,420 --> 00:20:14,230
Go on.

342
00:20:14,920 --> 00:20:15,720
Do it.

343
00:20:19,920 --> 00:20:21,130
Don't just say it.

344
00:20:33,720 --> 00:20:34,450
Rin,

345
00:20:37,360 --> 00:20:38,320
you're fired.

346
00:20:40,320 --> 00:20:41,320
From now on,

347
00:20:42,320 --> 00:20:44,220
don't show up to do Nine's hair.

348
00:20:48,210 --> 00:20:49,210
That can't be...

349
00:20:56,330 --> 00:20:57,720
I did nothing wrong.

350
00:20:59,000 --> 00:21:00,640
Can you stop being
fucking insane like him?!

351
00:21:02,710 --> 00:21:03,600
Who the fuck are you calling insane?!

352
00:21:03,620 --> 00:21:04,480
- Huh? Who?!
- Ow!

353
00:21:04,500 --> 00:21:05,440
- Who?!
- Nine!

354
00:21:05,460 --> 00:21:06,560
- Nine!
- Huh?!

355
00:21:06,730 --> 00:21:08,480
Spit it. Spit it out!

356
00:21:08,630 --> 00:21:10,550
Tell me what Juno
is plotting against me!

357
00:21:10,570 --> 00:21:11,770
And when did you conspire with him?!

358
00:21:11,790 --> 00:21:12,840
Spit it out!!

359
00:21:13,020 --> 00:21:14,000
- Huh?!
- Asshole!

360
00:21:14,120 --> 00:21:15,060
I said I didn't do it!

361
00:21:15,080 --> 00:21:16,240
Throw yourself in jail, then!

362
00:21:16,520 --> 00:21:17,520
Go on, you piece of shit!

363
00:21:18,630 --> 00:21:20,200
Nine, Nine, you need to calm down.

364
00:21:20,220 --> 00:21:21,810
We've been friends for ten years.

365
00:21:21,830 --> 00:21:22,920
What he's been saying today

366
00:21:23,110 --> 00:21:24,230
is not a lie!

367
00:21:24,250 --> 00:21:25,250
So you're backing him up?

368
00:21:25,270 --> 00:21:26,330
- Hell no!
- Huh?

369
00:21:26,350 --> 00:21:27,530
- I'm not!
- Nine.

370
00:21:27,550 --> 00:21:28,510
Nine, this is getting too far.

371
00:21:28,530 --> 00:21:29,430
Shut the hell up!

372
00:21:32,110 --> 00:21:33,480
Do you jerks have any damn clue...

373
00:21:35,020 --> 00:21:36,640
how fucking hard it was

374
00:21:36,660 --> 00:21:38,220
to make it here?!

375
00:21:39,310 --> 00:21:41,120
Fuck, it wasn't easy at all!!

376
00:21:47,130 --> 00:21:49,760
And I refuse to die
because of you sad excuses for people!

377
00:21:52,850 --> 00:21:54,560
And if you don't want to fucking die,

378
00:21:56,060 --> 00:21:57,760
I'm giving you two damn options.

379
00:21:59,940 --> 00:22:02,200
You have to help me
drag those two assholes to jail,

380
00:22:02,530 --> 00:22:04,540
- or you could...
- I admit it!

381
00:22:08,420 --> 00:22:09,750
I love Juno

382
00:22:12,530 --> 00:22:14,680
the same way Sunny loves you.

383
00:22:17,820 --> 00:22:19,240
Our ties can't be severed.

384
00:22:26,240 --> 00:22:27,650
I didn't even know about it.

385
00:22:28,820 --> 00:22:30,280
I swear.

386
00:22:31,320 --> 00:22:33,360
I didn't know what he did to you!

387
00:22:35,530 --> 00:22:37,160
And the situation with that bitch Pla, too.

388
00:22:44,820 --> 00:22:45,680
Wow...

389
00:22:47,120 --> 00:22:48,220
Wow!

390
00:22:51,040 --> 00:22:52,420
So you know that bitch's name.

391
00:22:55,830 --> 00:22:58,240
She's friends with Juno.
Of course I do.

392
00:23:01,520 --> 00:23:02,530
I'm sorry, Rin.

393
00:23:04,420 --> 00:23:06,410
You didn't get your answers quite right.

394
00:23:07,820 --> 00:23:08,920
Get the hell out,

395
00:23:09,040 --> 00:23:09,880
you bastard!

396
00:23:18,720 --> 00:23:19,360
Fine.

397
00:23:21,820 --> 00:23:23,520
If you want me to be the culprit so much,

398
00:23:25,930 --> 00:23:26,930
I can become one.

399
00:23:59,120 --> 00:23:59,960
Here.

400
00:24:00,210 --> 00:24:02,410
Right now, there are only
Nine and Sunny upstairs.

401
00:24:02,430 --> 00:24:03,480
Go up there, sweetie.

402
00:24:03,920 --> 00:24:05,210
Thank you, Toto.

403
00:24:05,230 --> 00:24:06,360
Why did you only take one?

404
00:24:06,380 --> 00:24:07,560
That's the best I could do.

405
00:24:08,930 --> 00:24:10,280
So how did you take on Nine's gig?

406
00:24:10,830 --> 00:24:11,820
Well, someone called me in,

407
00:24:11,840 --> 00:24:13,040
so I just took it.

408
00:24:13,230 --> 00:24:15,560
I didn't think I'd be working
for that bastard, though.

409
00:24:16,120 --> 00:24:17,840
Right, and what about Rin?

410
00:24:18,420 --> 00:24:19,830
He was fired,

411
00:24:20,040 --> 00:24:21,200
fresh out of the job.

412
00:24:21,220 --> 00:24:22,710
That's not all of it.

413
00:24:22,730 --> 00:24:24,680
He told Rin to bow at his feet

414
00:24:24,700 --> 00:24:26,440
and even grabbed Rin by his hair.

415
00:24:27,130 --> 00:24:28,130
It was intense.

416
00:24:28,160 --> 00:24:29,080
Holy shit!

417
00:24:29,130 --> 00:24:30,790
This is getting too far.

418
00:24:30,810 --> 00:24:31,620
Tell me about it.

419
00:24:31,640 --> 00:24:32,230
Told you,

420
00:24:32,250 --> 00:24:34,440
if you turned this whole thing
into a series, it'd blow up for sure.

421
00:24:34,460 --> 00:24:35,720
I'll help with the script.

422
00:24:36,020 --> 00:24:36,770
I should be the one...

423
00:24:36,790 --> 00:24:38,520
who takes responsibility.

424
00:24:40,420 --> 00:24:42,440
You know why I'm coming forward
with the truth, Wan?

425
00:24:49,330 --> 00:24:51,830
Because we created that monster.

426
00:24:56,620 --> 00:24:57,960
Are you sure you want to do this?

427
00:24:59,500 --> 00:25:00,800
I am, Cher.

428
00:25:02,220 --> 00:25:03,120
Wan, I don't think it's a good idea.

429
00:25:03,140 --> 00:25:04,320
Don't go up there.

430
00:25:04,340 --> 00:25:06,400
It's already gotten physical.

431
00:25:06,710 --> 00:25:07,830
And you're going in there alone

432
00:25:07,850 --> 00:25:09,130
without me.

433
00:25:09,330 --> 00:25:11,240
No, I have to do this.

434
00:25:13,120 --> 00:25:14,200
Can you go with him, then?

435
00:25:15,220 --> 00:25:16,020
Mm.

436
00:25:16,440 --> 00:25:18,080
I can do this on my own, Cher.

437
00:25:18,500 --> 00:25:19,960
Don't worry about me.

438
00:25:20,100 --> 00:25:21,400
I'll leave as soon as possible.

439
00:25:23,210 --> 00:25:24,830
That way, you won't get in trouble.

440
00:25:30,520 --> 00:25:31,520
Hey, Wan!

441
00:25:34,920 --> 00:25:36,120
In case you run into a journalist.

442
00:25:37,620 --> 00:25:38,520
Alright.

443
00:25:42,710 --> 00:25:44,480
It was such a fucking blast upstairs.

444
00:25:44,720 --> 00:25:45,930
It was wild, girl.

445
00:25:45,950 --> 00:25:46,880
Why didn't you record it in secret?

446
00:25:46,900 --> 00:25:49,040
I loved it when Rin shed tears.

447
00:25:49,310 --> 00:25:50,680
I've been dying to see that for ages.

448
00:25:51,630 --> 00:25:52,690
Was it your dream?

449
00:25:52,710 --> 00:25:53,640
Heck yeah.

450
00:25:54,710 --> 00:25:56,200
But I had to like, act cute...

451
00:25:56,330 --> 00:25:57,720
- Play it cool.
- And what did you do?

452
00:25:58,030 --> 00:25:59,940
I just stood there completely still.

453
00:25:59,960 --> 00:26:00,760
You were like...

454
00:26:01,820 --> 00:26:03,120
- This?
- Like...

455
00:26:03,510 --> 00:26:04,500
A cute little smirk.

456
00:26:04,530 --> 00:26:05,520
But inside, you were like...

457
00:26:05,850 --> 00:26:06,760
- "Huh!"
- Heck yeah.

458
00:26:15,230 --> 00:26:16,830
Nine found out that Rin

459
00:26:17,210 --> 00:26:19,080
had a meal with Pla and me,

460
00:26:20,430 --> 00:26:21,760
so he fired him.

461
00:26:28,830 --> 00:26:30,230
Don't feel guilty.

462
00:26:30,530 --> 00:26:32,840
Right now, we have to become
even angrier at Nine.

463
00:26:33,900 --> 00:26:35,280
Given how it turned out,

464
00:26:36,400 --> 00:26:37,640
all we can do is keep going.

465
00:26:38,130 --> 00:26:40,840
I don't think he's doing as Wan says.

466
00:26:41,710 --> 00:26:42,500
Exactly.

467
00:26:42,520 --> 00:26:44,430
Let's not wait. This has to be done ASAP.

468
00:26:44,450 --> 00:26:45,320
No,

469
00:26:46,320 --> 00:26:47,940
we already promised Wan.

470
00:26:48,320 --> 00:26:49,180
We have to wait.

471
00:27:19,010 --> 00:27:19,910
Why are you here?

472
00:27:19,930 --> 00:27:20,620
Mama,

473
00:27:22,630 --> 00:27:23,680
I'll handle it.

474
00:27:24,730 --> 00:27:25,930
- Nine, but he...
- Mama!

475
00:27:25,950 --> 00:27:27,530
Let me handle it. Just leave for now.

476
00:27:46,120 --> 00:27:47,840
I heard you went back home
to make noodle soup.

477
00:27:48,120 --> 00:27:49,020
How did it go?

478
00:27:49,230 --> 00:27:50,400
Were you happy?

479
00:27:53,030 --> 00:27:54,030
Pretty good.

480
00:27:56,830 --> 00:27:57,710
Good to hear.

481
00:27:59,090 --> 00:28:00,960
Some professions are just
not meant for us, huh?

482
00:28:03,220 --> 00:28:04,840
Why did you fire Rin?

483
00:28:08,770 --> 00:28:11,300
Woo! Look at how fast word travels.

484
00:28:12,210 --> 00:28:13,210
It's nothing.

485
00:28:14,030 --> 00:28:15,160
There were just some problems.

486
00:28:17,430 --> 00:28:20,400
Guess I have to give them rat poison
to kill the whole nest next time.

487
00:28:21,520 --> 00:28:23,600
Like how you paid someone
to leak the video at the MD event,

488
00:28:23,620 --> 00:28:24,400
the guy named Co?

489
00:28:35,420 --> 00:28:37,920
You're not here
to congratulate me, are you?

490
00:28:39,910 --> 00:28:41,060
I'm here to ask you to tell the truth

491
00:28:41,080 --> 00:28:43,000
about how I didn't shove you into the pool.

492
00:28:43,510 --> 00:28:45,310
Right...

493
00:28:47,140 --> 00:28:48,530
So that's what it actually is?

494
00:28:49,930 --> 00:28:51,160
It's not Rin,

495
00:28:51,530 --> 00:28:53,130
Juno,

496
00:28:54,040 --> 00:28:55,630
or that fucking sasaeng.

497
00:28:56,720 --> 00:28:58,920
You're the one who's behind all this, huh?

498
00:28:59,830 --> 00:29:00,630
Aren't you?!

499
00:29:00,920 --> 00:29:01,640
Huh?!

500
00:29:03,930 --> 00:29:04,930
Nine,

501
00:29:05,910 --> 00:29:08,440
I'm here to warn you
before it all goes down.

502
00:29:08,930 --> 00:29:10,420
Someone really has proof on hand.

503
00:29:10,440 --> 00:29:11,170
What proof?

504
00:29:11,190 --> 00:29:12,140
Everything!

505
00:29:13,420 --> 00:29:15,080
Both the evidence and the witness.

506
00:29:15,220 --> 00:29:17,310
What you've done to people

507
00:29:17,330 --> 00:29:19,390
will be revealed
after this press conference.

508
00:29:19,420 --> 00:29:20,730
Are you threatening me? Huh?

509
00:29:20,750 --> 00:29:21,640
I'm not.

510
00:29:22,010 --> 00:29:23,720
This is not a threat, but a warning.

511
00:29:27,010 --> 00:29:27,920
You know?

512
00:29:29,500 --> 00:29:30,600
You were terrible

513
00:29:31,320 --> 00:29:32,730
on your first day,

514
00:29:33,520 --> 00:29:35,330
now your acting is still
the same fucking flop.

515
00:29:35,660 --> 00:29:36,530
Do you realize that?

516
00:29:36,550 --> 00:29:37,480
I'm being honest.

517
00:29:43,020 --> 00:29:43,860
What the hell?!

518
00:29:43,880 --> 00:29:45,000
Give me your phone!

519
00:29:45,420 --> 00:29:46,660
Give me your damn phone!

520
00:29:47,480 --> 00:29:48,760
You're recording it, right?

521
00:29:49,310 --> 00:29:50,520
You're recording it, right?!

522
00:30:23,130 --> 00:30:24,810
How could you even stand yourself?

523
00:30:24,830 --> 00:30:26,620
Have you ever looked at
yourself in the mirror?

524
00:30:27,620 --> 00:30:30,160
You're not the person
whose photos I took every day anymore.

525
00:30:30,570 --> 00:30:32,200
I don't even know who the fuck you are.

526
00:30:40,220 --> 00:30:41,400
So, you want me to...

527
00:30:42,900 --> 00:30:44,720
confess about
the video at the MD event?

528
00:30:45,410 --> 00:30:47,210
Then you're gonna abandon your noodle shop

529
00:30:47,230 --> 00:30:49,020
and glide back beautifully
into the industry

530
00:30:49,820 --> 00:30:50,920
while my fucking life

531
00:30:51,260 --> 00:30:52,210
falls apart completely?!

532
00:30:52,230 --> 00:30:53,150
No!

533
00:30:53,170 --> 00:30:54,240
I don't believe you.

534
00:30:57,340 --> 00:30:59,900
The reason I staged myself
falling into the pool

535
00:30:59,920 --> 00:31:01,120
was because of you.

536
00:31:01,320 --> 00:31:03,150
And the reason I'm struggling

537
00:31:03,170 --> 00:31:04,040
to get rid of you

538
00:31:04,060 --> 00:31:06,000
is that you were
taking everything from me!

539
00:31:06,020 --> 00:31:06,970
Do you dare say

540
00:31:06,990 --> 00:31:07,880
that it wasn't true?!

541
00:31:07,900 --> 00:31:08,840
It was true!

542
00:31:11,540 --> 00:31:12,680
Not everything was, though.

543
00:31:13,040 --> 00:31:14,560
Back then, I lied to you

544
00:31:14,580 --> 00:31:16,030
that I wasn't into Third

545
00:31:16,410 --> 00:31:18,200
when I actually
had feelings for your partner.

546
00:31:18,430 --> 00:31:19,640
You got that one right.

547
00:31:26,770 --> 00:31:27,840
Fucking knew it...

548
00:31:32,900 --> 00:31:34,380
It's too late to confess now, right?

549
00:31:35,930 --> 00:31:36,910
I know,

550
00:31:38,230 --> 00:31:39,680
but it's not too late for you.

551
00:31:40,420 --> 00:31:41,590
I'm begging you

552
00:31:41,610 --> 00:31:43,680
to please end this yourself.

553
00:31:43,800 --> 00:31:45,610
Don't let other people do it.

554
00:31:58,700 --> 00:31:59,500
Play it.

555
00:32:00,320 --> 00:32:01,120
Hm?

556
00:32:01,820 --> 00:32:02,540
Do it.

