01:04:25,200 --> 01:04:26,200
Thank...

1108
01:04:28,340 --> 01:04:30,720
Thank you for loving me...

1109
01:04:33,020 --> 01:04:34,280
Do this again

1110
01:04:35,210 --> 01:04:36,440
and I'll hit you.

1111
01:04:36,590 --> 01:04:38,600
I'll hit you to death, you hear me?

1112
01:04:49,750 --> 01:04:50,960
Thank you, Wan.

1113
01:04:52,730 --> 01:04:53,830
Truly, thank you.

1114
01:05:50,270 --> 01:05:51,220
What happened?

1115
01:05:52,010 --> 01:05:53,120
Why are you here?

1116
01:05:55,350 --> 01:05:56,510
You're okay, right?

1117
01:06:01,810 --> 01:06:03,280
It's over now, Wan.

1118
01:06:05,260 --> 01:06:06,010
Mm...

1119
01:06:07,490 --> 01:06:08,780
It really is over.

1120
01:06:16,410 --> 01:06:17,220
You know?

1121
01:06:19,850 --> 01:06:21,080
I ended up here

1122
01:06:23,200 --> 01:06:24,760
because Nine was about
to jump off the building.

1123
01:07:02,100 --> 01:07:03,280
Is this it, Third?

1124
01:07:06,480 --> 01:07:07,960
Is this what we wanted?

1125
01:07:29,040 --> 01:07:32,610
[OnetoNine (Rest)]

1126
01:07:35,600 --> 01:07:37,720
[OnetoNine (Closed)]

1127
01:07:47,100 --> 01:07:48,280
Hi, girlie.

1128
01:07:48,510 --> 01:07:49,580
Oh, girlie.

1129
01:07:49,600 --> 01:07:51,720
I'm here to ask you
to come audition for a series.

1130
01:07:53,680 --> 01:07:55,520
If you can't get it sorted, just quit!

1131
01:07:55,590 --> 01:07:57,840
Do not let your emotions
take over during work,

1132
01:07:57,860 --> 01:07:59,780
or you'd never
be able to win against Wut.

1133
01:07:59,800 --> 01:08:01,240
Go talk it over.

1134
01:08:01,640 --> 01:08:03,080
I'm glad you came today.

1135
01:08:03,480 --> 01:08:04,480
Winning my heart

1136
01:08:04,940 --> 01:08:05,790
isn't easy.

1137
01:08:05,810 --> 01:08:07,440
Wan, are you finally awake?!

1138
01:08:07,520 --> 01:08:08,520
I already told my mom

1139
01:08:08,610 --> 01:08:09,520
that you were my boyfriend.

1140
01:08:09,690 --> 01:08:11,360
I haven't even said yes.

1141
01:08:11,380 --> 01:08:12,380
Will you be my boyfriend?

1142
01:08:30,979 --> 01:08:33,960
♫Everything I've ever wanted,♫

1143
01:08:33,979 --> 01:08:38,000
♫I've traded it all with tears♫

1144
01:08:38,020 --> 01:08:42,220
♫I don't care how people see it♫

1145
01:08:43,520 --> 01:08:46,620
♫Being at the top is the reason I'm here♫

1146
01:08:46,640 --> 01:08:50,720
♫I don't care
whose heads I have to step over♫

1147
01:08:50,740 --> 01:08:52,250
♫For my longing,♫

1148
01:08:52,270 --> 01:08:55,319
♫I'm ready to sacrifice everything♫

1149
01:08:55,520 --> 01:08:58,660
♫Enraged by those
who never look my way,♫

1150
01:08:58,680 --> 01:09:01,620
♫Hatred brims
'cause they never care anyway♫

1151
01:09:01,640 --> 01:09:03,740
♫I'm willing to make sacrifices,♫

1152
01:09:03,760 --> 01:09:05,859
♫So why am I
the one who loses this time?♫

1153
01:09:05,880 --> 01:09:08,930
♫I laid down my life for it♫

1154
01:09:08,950 --> 01:09:12,080
♫So why would I yield?♫

1155
01:09:12,100 --> 01:09:15,300
♫Laid down my life for it♫

1156
01:09:15,319 --> 01:09:18,779
♫Over my dead body, I'd never yield♫

1157
01:09:18,800 --> 01:09:22,420
♫I'd accept nothing♫

1158
01:09:22,439 --> 01:09:25,939
♫If it means I'm losing♫

1159
01:09:25,960 --> 01:09:29,510
♫I've given it all up till I had no one♫

1160
01:09:29,529 --> 01:09:35,819
♫Are you dreaming,
thinking I'd yield at once?♫

1161
01:09:36,189 --> 01:09:39,380
♫If this is how it unfolds,♫

1162
01:09:39,410 --> 01:09:44,540
♫I'd rather disappear forever♫

1163
01:09:44,560 --> 01:09:46,729
♫If I had to surrender,♫

1164
01:09:47,240 --> 01:09:50,550
♫Wouldn't you say it was absurd?♫

1165
01:09:50,830 --> 01:09:53,920
♫If this is how I lose, I lose,♫

1166
01:09:53,939 --> 01:09:59,360
♫I'd rather die, I would♫

1167
01:10:04,560 --> 01:10:09,360
[Mr. Fanboy Series]
